## Critical mitigation

**Critical gap:** Bias (Fairness)

**Why critical:** We've flagged this as the most critical risk because if it keeps mis-tagging certain sectors or regions, that skew goes straight into Sales/Strategy calls and might affect business. 

**Mitigation plan:** To close this gap we will build a bias test set with 100 items, deliberately spread across sectors, regions, company sizes so nothing's underrepresented. Run per-group accuracy monghlh, code-based, flag any group whose error rate is more than 2x the average. Add a manual review on whatever gets flagged, to tell real model bias apart from groups that just naturally get talked about differently.


